meta {
  name: Delete Current User
  type: http
  seq: 8
  tags: [
    auth
    protected
    destructive
  ]
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Soft-deletes the authenticated user and the active user_details row by setting deleted_at. The request uses the Bearer token subject; it does not accept a user ID.

  Success response: 200 with data.deleted set to true. After deletion, the access token cannot be used for protected endpoints and the account cannot log in while deleted_at is set. Do not run this request against a user you need to keep.
}
